  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-preview.3: First public preview. Azure Key Vault-backed IPostQuantumKeyStore for PostQuantum.DataProtection. Stores ML-KEM-768 keypairs as Key Vault Secrets (one secret per keypair plus a small \"active\" pointer secret); the PQ secret key is already envelope-encrypted by the host IContentKeyProvider before it touches the vault. Supports DefaultAzureCredential out of the box and any TokenCredential a caller wants to supply. Concurrent-safe; the \"active\" pointer is updated atomically through Key Vault's per-secret versioning. Tracks roadmap items in PostQuantum.DataProtection/future.md. No third-party audit yet; see PostQuantum.DataProtection/KNOWN-GAPS.md for scope.",
